    "updated_at": "2026-03-13T14:13:30Z",
    "body": "Hi everyone,\nI’ve implemented a Vault module that shows token expiration time (based on vault token lookup --format=json) with configurable display options. I opened a PR to close this issue (#2195).\n\nThanks to @bbigras for the original request and to others for the discussion — I’ve tried to follow the suggested approach and included docs, presets, schema updates, and tests.",
